<div class="card">
  <h2>Key safety rules</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Speed limit: No driving over 70 mph.</b> This is a company rule for fuel economy, safety, and the law.</li>
    <li>Always complete your DVIR (daily vehicle inspection) before you start. If there is a defect, do not drive — report it.</li>
    <li>If you are drowsy, rest. Drowsy driving is never allowed.</li>
    <li>Wear safety gear during container work and follow port rules.</li>
    <li>If there is an accident or a contact incident, notify the company right away and secure photos and the other vehicle's plate number.</li>
  </ul>
